{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_19","type":"command_execution","command":"/opt/homebrew/bin/zsh -lc \"ls -la poc/data/sealed-2026-10-24-run3-through-0815\nnl -ba docs/research/2026-10-25-english/data-manifest.md | sed -n '10,32p'\nrg -n 'sealed-2026-10-24-run3-through-0815|archive.sqlite' docs/poc/service.md | head -35\nnl -ba src/hivemind/model.py | sed -n '36,83p'\"","aggregated_output":"total 9856\ndr-xr-xr-x@  10 lchingen  staff      320 Oct 23 12:14 .\ndrwxr-xr-x@ 251 lchingen  staff     8032 Nov 23 02:17 ..\n-r--r--r--@   1 lchingen  staff     1117 Oct 23 12:14 SHA256SUMS\n-r--r--r--@   1 lchingen  staff    32768 Oct 23 12:13 agent.sqlite\n-r--r--r--@   1 lchingen  staff     6558 Oct 23 12:13 mappings.csv\n-r--r--r--@   1 lchingen  staff    31303 Oct 23 12:13 replay.log\ndr-xr-xr-x@   9 lchingen  staff      288 Oct 23 12:14 report\n-r--r--r--@   1 lchingen  staff     3558 Oct 23 12:13 run3-to-0815.out\n-r--r--r--@   1 lchingen  staff  4358144 Oct 23 12:13 views.sqlite\n-r--r--r--@   1 lchingen  staff   606208 Oct 23 12:13 views.sqlite.day0.sqlite\n    10\t| file | what it is | SHA-256 |\n    11\t|---|---|---|\n    12\t| `poc/data/items-window-tags2-2026-10-24.sqlite` | the item window every English run replays (2026-02-25 to 2026-08-15) | 02791fd2b1b3d6ab |\n    13\t\n    14\t## The measured ledgers (build log rows 43–49)\n    15\t\n    16\tEach folder holds `views.sqlite` (the ledger), `archive.sqlite` (every model and Jev call, request and answer), the run logs, and for the two D167 arms a week snapshot (`views.week.sqlite`, `archive.week.sqlite`) taken before August.\n    17\t\n    18\t| folder | configuration | window | role | views | archive |\n    19\t|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n    20\t| `english-v23-jev-2026-10-25` | `poc-v23` (extraction v10, Jev matching) | seed, week, Aug 1–15 | D167 arm; the default engine from D169 | f6ba83ffa79caafc | bc3e769937323819 |\n    21\t| `english-v23-llm-2026-10-25` | `poc-v23-llm` (extraction v10, generative matching) | seed, week, Aug 1–15 | D167 control arm | a1ee44f68a179705 | d629f8df6b308a39 |\n    22\t| `english-groups4-2026-10-25` | `poc-v21` | seed, week | control of the first Jev benchmark (row 41) | fe11a3bf86342f2c | 5b5042a5e5140125 |\n    23\t| `english-jev2-2026-10-25` | `poc-v22` | seed, week | Jev arm of the first benchmark (row 41) | cfe09822456e9cd7 | 5bab7f8d33740f3f |\n    24\t| `english-jev3-2026-10-25` | `poc-v22`, fixed engine | seed | engine replicate (row 37) | c460b6797a475645 | 406654ab0aeffed2 |\n    25\t| `english-jev-2026-10-25` | `poc-v22`, first criteria | seed | first Jev seed (row 35) | c589e2304f3d3e9e | c7a462e4e4e129ad |\n    26\t| `english-2026-10-25` | `poc-v17`–`v20` | seed, week, part of August | the English library build (rows 1–33) | — | 8bec7d710f0259ea |\n    27\t| `english-groups-2026-10-25`, `-groups2-`, `-groups3-` | `poc-v19`–`v20` | seed or week | research-group iterations | baa802da5ea78c16 / 0ead32d89874db73 / 1160c9e522d85658 | 91ebcdebe66a176b / e0ab4d37ed9d7fa1 / a8d4535343896be9 |\n    28\t\n    29\t## Earlier material, kept as found\n    30\t\n    31\t`keyed-2026-10-25/` (the keyed-views rebuild, D155+), `sealed-2026-10-24-run3-*` (sealed ledgers with their own `SHA256SUMS`), `old-2026-10-23-run*`, `service/` (the service's idea archive, search index and timing runs), and the loose `views-2026-10-25-v1*.sqlite`, `archive.sqlite`, `views.sqlite` files at the top of `poc/data/`.\n    32\t\n    36\t          'jev-1.14.0': (0.042, 0.0)}   # Jev: docs.typesafe.ai/models, 2026-10-25; output free   # DeepSeek: peak-hour list prices, cache misses (2026-10-23 pricing page)\n    37\tCACHED_INPUT_SHARE = 0.10          # cached input tokens are priced at 10% of the input rate (gpt-6-luna page, read again 2026-10-27)\n    38\t\n    39\tSCHEMA_SQL = \"\"\"\n    40\tcreate table if not exists model_calls (\n    41\t  call_id integer primary key autoincrement, purpose text, config_version text, config_checksum text, model text,\n    42\t  request_sha256 text unique, request_json text, response_json text, answer_json text, prompt_chars integer,\n    43\t  input_tokens integer, output_tokens integer, cost_usd real, seconds real, created_at text\n    44\t);\n    45\tcreate index if not exists model_calls_sha on model_calls(request_sha256);\n    46\t\"\"\"\n    47\t\n    48\t\n    49\tclass SchemaError(ValueError):\n    50\t    pass\n    51\t\n    52\t\n    53\tclass TransportError(RuntimeError):\n    54\t    pass\n    55\t\n    56\t\n    57\t@dataclasses.dataclass\n    58\tclass Answer:\n    59\t    data: dict\n    60\t    call_id: int\n    61\t    request_sha256: str\n    62\t    cached: bool\n    63\t    prompt_chars: int\n    64\t    input_tokens: int\n    65\t    output_tokens: int\n    66\t    cost_usd: float\n    67\t\n    68\t\n    69\tclass Archive:\n    70\t    \"\"\"Shared by the extraction worker threads: one connection, every access under a lock.\"\"\"\n    71\t\n    72\t    def __init__(self, path):\n    73\t        os.makedirs(os.path.dirname(os.path.abspath(path)), exist_ok=True)\n    74\t        self.conn = sqlite3.connect(path, check_same_thread=False)\n    75\t        self.conn.executescript(SCHEMA_SQL)\n    76\t        import threading\n    77\t        self.lock = threading.Lock()\n    78\t\n    79\t    def lookup(self, sha):\n    80\t        with self.lock:\n    81\t            return self.conn.execute('select call_id, answer_json, prompt_chars, input_tokens, output_tokens from model_calls where request_sha256=?', (sha,)).fetchone()\n    82\t\n    83\t    def record(self, **fields):\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
