{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_30","type":"command_execution","command":"/opt/homebrew/bin/zsh -lc \"nl -ba poc/data/served-2026-10-28-v34-nvda-3m-through-0828/README.md\nrg -n 'Restriction adopted|No restriction adopted' docs scripts tests poc --glob '\"'!*.stream'\"' --glob '\"'!*.json*'\"' --glob '\"'!*.html'\"' --glob '\"'!*.out'\"' --glob '\"'!*.csv'\"' | head -20\"","aggregated_output":"     1\t# Served copy of the sealed 2026-10-28 ledger, minus v68\n     2\t\n     3\t`views.sqlite` = `sealed-2026-10-28-v34-nvda-3m-through-0828/views.sqlite` with thesis v68 removed (Alex, 2026-10-28 17:05:\n     4\t\"你直接把它移除，这是我们自己的失误\"). v68, \"What stand-alone CPU revenue will NVIDIA report for calendar 2027?\", was opened on the\n     5\trun's last day by the succession rule (same quantity, next period, after v24) and the writer linked its one opening statement to\n     6\tv7 and v24 instead of to it, so it stood with no evidence and no judgement. Rows removed: views, view_keys, rungs, successions,\n     7\tview_switches, views_fts for v68 (no evidence_links or judgements existed). The sealed folder is untouched and remains the record;\n     8\tthe front end, the API and the page build read this copy.\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md:3509:- Alex, after the browser check showed v49's state as \"No No restriction adopted\": \"修，然后 merge main\".\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md:3510:- Mechanism: the state chip and the chart's spoken text join the score and the rung label. A two-rung ladder's score is Yes/No; when the ladder names its outcomes (06-views allows named outcomes for yes/no theme theses), the label repeats it. Census: 1 of 55 two-rung theses in the served ledger (v49: Restriction adopted / No restriction adopted) and 1 in the 2026-10-27 snapshot (Permission granted / Permission not granted).\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md:3512:- Result: the D336 UI test fails on the old composition (\"No No restriction adopted\"); 58 UI tests, lint, format and the 20 standing UI mutation checks pass. In headless Chrome, with the cache disabled, v49 shows \"No restriction adopted\" and v14 \"Yes\".\npoc/ui/test/composite.test.js:302:  named.rungs[0].label = 'Restriction adopted';\npoc/ui/test/composite.test.js:303:  named.rungs[1].label = 'No restriction adopted';\npoc/ui/test/composite.test.js:308:  assert.equal(stateText(thesis, 2), 'No restriction adopted');\npoc/ui/test/composite.test.js:311:    '<span class=\"chip chip--state state--negative\"><b>No restriction adopted</b></span>',\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
